        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.75m (5'9\") x 6.47m (21'3\")\nWith Storage closet\n\nMain bedroom - 3.82m (12'6\") x 5.24m (17'2\")\nBuilt in wardrobes and en-suite\n\nEn-sute - 1.2m (3'11\") x 2.22m (7'3\")\nShower, WHB and WC\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.37m (11'1\") x 4.49m (14'9\")\nBuilt in wardrobes\n\nMain bathroom - 1.63m (5'4\") x 2.14m (7'0\")\nBath with overhead shower, WHB and WC\n\nLiving Room - 3.35m (11'0\") x 4.21m (13'10\")\nFeature fireplace and door to balcony\n\nDining Room - 2.06m (6'9\") x 4.21m (13'10\")\nAdjacent to kitchen\n\nKitchen - 3.63m (11'11\") x 1.91m (6'3\")\ninter-grated appliances\n\nBalcony - 2.92m (9'7\") x 1.15m (3'9\")\n\nNotice\nIntending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy\nof all information and measurements in this listing. Any particulars\nprovided are for guidance only and do not constitute a contract or a part of\none. We do not accept responsibility for any loss or damage arising from\nreliance on this information. Purchasers should seek independent legal and\nprofessional advice."
